<h2 style="color:#9c173b;letter-spacing:.15em;text-shadow:0 0 12px #ff0546">THE ALTAR</h2><div class="contain-aster"><img src="https://scpdsandbox.wdfiles.com/local--files/billith9/jelly.gif" alt="altar" width="160" height="160" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;filter:hue-rotate(310deg) saturate(1.5)"></div><p style="text-align:center;font-style:italic;color:#660f31">"Bring something. The altar is hungry, and it is not picky."</p>
<p>The altar is older than the world you know. Reality is a room once built to hide the altar's existence. The walls are made of collective belief in their opacity. If you wish to see through them, your business is with the altar. Do not delay.</p><p>Six candles must burn. Five have yet to meet this fate.</p>
<div style="border:1px solid #660f31;padding:18px;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;background:rgba(156,23,59,0.08);text-align:left"><p style="color:#9c173b;letter-spacing:.1em"><strong>OFFERINGS RECEIVED:</strong></p><p style="color:#660f31;font-family:'Overpass Mono',monospace;font-size:.88em;line-height:1.7"> ◆ one basilisk tooth, premolar, root intact - <em>BLURSED BY ANONYMOUS</em>
 ◆ <del>a vile name spoken backwards</del> - <em>RETURNED, NAMED ENTITY NO LONGER EXISTS</em>
 ◆ one collection of dreams about a lover - <em>RECEIVED, SAVORING</em>
 ◆ <del>one memory of blood pooling between yellow tiles.</del> - <em>ENSHRINED, EDIFIED</em>
 ◆ the last thing spoken by loved one of [ACCOUNT DELETED] before passing - <em>STILL OUTSTANDING</em>
 ◆ <strong>YOUR TURN.</strong> - <em>AWAITING</em></p></div>
<p>You may approach.</p>
<div class="button-container"><button class="game-button click" onclick="hexAltarOffer()">MAKE OFFERING</button><button class="game-button click" onclick="showSectionWithDelay("facade")">WITHDRAW</button></div>
<p id="hex-altar-response" style="text-align:center;color:#9c173b;min-height:1.4em;font-style:italic"></p><div class="contain-aster"><img src="https://scpdsandbox.wdfiles.com/local--files/billith9/dissolve.gif" alt="dissolve" width="128" height="128" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;opacity:0.55"></div></div><div id="rift" class="content">
<h2 style="color:#9c173b;letter-spacing:.2em;text-shadow:0 0 20px #ff0546">THE RIFT</h2><div class="contain-aster"><img src="https://scpdsandbox.wdfiles.com/local--files/billith9/gathering.gif" alt="rift" width="200" height="200" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;filter:hue-rotate(290deg) brightness(.8) saturate(1.4)"></div><p style="text-align:center;color:#660f31;font-family:'Overpass Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.05em">[ COORDINATES: 41.8240° N, 71.4128° W - PROVIDENCE, R.I. ]</p><p style="text-align:center;color:#9c173b;font-style:italic">"It has opened. More to follow."</p>
<p>You are certainly not the first visitor and you will definitely not be the last. Some came on a pilgrimage, others by pure chance (pure fate). You came because the rift sent for you, and you did not know you were being sent for until you were already here. Hi.</p>
<div style="border:1px dashed #ff0546;padding:18px;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:rgba(255,5,70,0.06);text-align:left"><p style="color:#9c173b;letter-spacing:.08em"><strong>FRAGMENTS RETRIEVED FROM THE OTHER SIDE:</strong></p><p style="color:#660f31;font-family:'Overpass Mono',monospace;font-size:.86em;line-height:1.8;white-space:pre-wrap">⬡ "there are five cardinal directions, and one of them is not for most to know. I am one of few that can show you, but we must act now. Send 5000 gamma to [ADDRESS REVOKED] to begin."



⬡ "i saw something that looked like my mother but it had too many bones, inside and out. it asked me when i was coming home. i told it i was already home, because i was sitting in my living room. then it laughed at me. i feel so ashamed :("



⬡ "the bell rings all the way down here too. you stop hearing other noises, after a while, if you let yourself go."



⬡ "there is a marketplace the merchants do not speak of. you put a question in front of them, they put an answer in front of you. you cannot leave without taking it along with you, forever."



⬡ "howdy cultish bookclub, how's the ascension going?"



⬡ "you really gotta stop calling us that, gregory."</p></div>
<p>You stand at the threshold. The rift awaits you.</p><p style="text-align:center;color:#9c173b">(It is not too late to turn back.)</p>
<div class="button-container"><button class="game-button click" onclick="hexRiftStep()">STEP THROUGH</button><button class="game-button click" onclick="showSectionWithDelay("altar")">RETURN TO ALTAR</button></div>
<p id="hex-rift-response" style="text-align:center;color:#ff0546;min-height:1.4em;font-style:italic;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto"></p>
<div class="contain-aster"><img src="https://scpdsandbox.wdfiles.com/local--files/billith9/braindeath.gif" alt="abyss" width="140" height="140" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;opacity:0.5;filter:hue-rotate(290deg)"></div></div><div id="theHouse" class="content"><button id="startButton" style="border:none">CONTEND</button><div id="targetSequence"></div><div id="grid"></div><div id="result"></div><div id="successDiv" style="display:none"><span style="margin:0 auto;text-align:center;display:block"><a href="/scp-8121" target="_blank" onclick="goToCredits(1,"Discovery")">JOIN US</a></span></div></div><img id="saveNotification" src="https://scpdsandbox.wdfiles.com/local--files/billith9/stroll.gif" alt="Saving..."><div id="wiki" class="content">
<h2 style="color:#1e579c;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif">SCP-XXXX :: THE LAST OASIS</h2><div style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;text-align:left;font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;color:#1e579c;line-height:1.65"><p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-UNASSIGNED</p><p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Keter-Cernunnos</p><p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> Investigation of SCP-UNASSIGNED is to be conducted exclusively through Foundation-issued HEXAGON OS terminals. Direct connection from civilian systems will result in immediate cognitohazardous exposure of the operator, followed by rapid brain death. Personnel are <strong>not</strong> to navigate to unknown domains without dual authorization from a Level-3 thaumaturge and SCP-UNASSIGNED's Project Lead.</p><p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-UNASSIGNED is the colloquial designation for a network of esoteric webpages collectively forming a black market occult network known as the <em>Tellus Obscura</em>. Much of what has been archived amounts to a recruitment apparatus for non-localized cults and anomalous criminal organizations, the most well-documented site of which is known as “<em>The Last Oasis</em>”. Visitors who complete its initiation process, which consists of personality quizzes, occult rites of passage, monetary donations, volunteer work, and other similar acts, are observed to experience progressive symptomologies including, but not limited to, prophetic dreams, obsession with hyperdimensional geometries, and so on.</p><p><strong>Addendum UNASSIGNED-1:</strong> Two additional domains have been linked to this occult entity. Internal documentation refers to them as the SUNKEN ROAD, and the DARK THRONE. Further domains have yet to be identified.</p><p><strong>Addendum scpf sucks 100x:</strong> We do not believe the WARDENS are aware of our activities beyond that which is most publicly accessible. We wish to keep it this way. Snazzy terminal though, not bad for a bunch of prudish dorks</p><p style="color:#a8141d;font-size:.85em"><em>(this article is undergoing rewrites. last edit: 2002-06-14 by user [REDACTED])</em></p></div></div><div id="altar" class="content">
<h2 style="color:#9c173b">THE ALTAR</h2><div class="ascii-container"><div class="ascii-art chamber-altar" style="text-align:center;line-height:1.3">

              ▼

           ▼ ▼ ▼

        ▼  ▼ ▼ ▼  ▼

     ╔═════════════╗

     ║             ║

     ║     ⬢       ║

     ║  ⬢  ⬢  ⬢  ║

     ║     ⬢       ║

     ║             ║

     ╚═════════════╝

        ║       ║

        ║ BONE  ║

        ║  ASH  ║

        ║  BELL ║

    </div></div><p style="text-align:center">A long stone surface, unusually smooth, wet with saltwater and something rust-colored. Three offerings have already been made, yours would be the fourth.</p><p style="text-align:center"><em>The bell hangs above. It has not yet been rung.</em></p><p style="text-align:center;color:#660f31"><em>"To place a hand here is to sign the pact in blood."</em></p>
<div style="text-align:center"><button class="game-button click" onclick="showSectionWithDelay('facade')" style="color:#660f31">RETREAT</button><button class="game-button2 click" onclick="showSectionWithDelay('rift')" style="color:#9c173b">APPROACH THE RIFT</button></div></div><div id="rift" class="content">
<h2 style="color:#9c173b">THE RIFT</h2><div class="ascii-container"><div class="ascii-art chamber-rift" style="text-align:center;line-height:1.2;color:#9c173b">

░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

