░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

    </div></div><p style="text-align:center;color:#9c173b"><em>"It is already open."</em></p><p style="text-align:center">This is not the first time the Wound of the World was open. They covered up the previous Events, wiped our minds, fixed the roads, swept up the bones and guts and everything else. This has happened at least three separate times, each worse than the last. Now, it bleeds freely and will not close, no matter how hard they may try.</p><p style="text-align:center">You feel it watching back through your retinas. Along with it, a hum at the edge of perception, sourced from a time long past, eats at you.</p>
<div style="text-align:center"><button class="game-button click" onclick="showSectionWithDelay('facade')" style="color:#660f31">WITHDRAW</button><button class="game-button2 click" onclick="showSectionWithDelay('bellchamber')" style="color:#9c173b">LISTEN FOR THE BELL</button></div></div><div id="bellchamber" class="content">
<h2 style="color:#9c173b">THE BELL CHAMBER</h2><div class="ascii-container"><div class="ascii-art chamber-bell" style="text-align:center;line-height:1.2;color:#9c173b">

