`@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@\\@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@'

 `============================\ \=========================='

    </div></div><p style="text-align:center">You stand directly beneath the bell. Its surface, where you can see it, is covered in a script resembling Linear B, you think. Its mouth is the size of a small house.</p><p style="text-align:center"><em>It has rung before. It will ring again. There is something underneath all of this, and it knows your name. You hear it, calling to you.</em></p><p style="text-align:center;color:#9c173b"><em>"What do you do?"</em></p>
<div style="text-align:center"><button class="game-button click" onclick="showSectionWithDelay('facade')" style="color:#660f31">FLEE</button></div></div><div id="wardens" class="content">
<h2>THE WARDENS</h2><p style="text-align:center;color:#660f31">You should not be here.</p><p style="max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center">This page is unlisted. Only those who are called to it may find themselves at its doorstep.</p><hr style="border-color:#270022;max-width:620px"><p style="max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;color:#9c173b;font-size:.92em"><em>INTERNAL ADVISORY - DO NOT REPLY</em></p><p style="max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;color:#9c173b;font-size:.92em"><em>The Wardens. The cowards that hide behind forgetting, who seek to control your every thought and movement. We know who they are, even if they do not want us to.</em></p><p style="max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;color:#9c173b;font-size:.92em"><em>If you encounter a Warden on the Obscura, disconnect your VPN connection and relink using fresh nodes.</em></p><p style="max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;color:#9c173b;font-size:.92em"><em>If you encounter a Warden in your own home, bad news and worse news. Bad news: you must destroy your terminal, completely. No traces. Worse news: if you let them, they will capture you. they will force you to talk. DO NOT let them have the luxury. DO NOT betray your fellow Obscurers. Understand, simply taking your own life is not enough. They will ressurect a digital effigy of your mind, and subject it to unimaginable pain, in a place where time has no meaning. Thus, physically destroying your own cerebellum (or cerebellum-equivalent) is your only escape. You will still be immortalized, but compassionately, lovingly, by That Which Sits Upon the Throne.</em></p>
<div style="text-align:center"><button class="game-button click" onclick="showSectionWithDelay('home')" style="color:#660f31">RETURN</button></div></div><div id="underground" class="content">
<h2 style="color:#39707a">THE UNDERGROUND</h2><p style="text-align:center;color:#39707a;font-style:italic">Access granted. Reputation tier: BLACK.</p><div class="listing" style="max-width:620px;margin:8px auto;border:1px dashed #39707a;padding:10px;text-align:left"><strong>HEXAGON OS [TERMINAL UNIT, USED]</strong><p>Price: 480 GMA :: Seller: <a class="click" onclick="showSectionWithDelay('profile')" style="color:#39707a">methymike23</a> :: Status: AVAILABLE</p><p style="font-size:0.85em;color:#666"><em>"Mine. No questions. Cracked, just for you. Includes the SCP toolkit you were not supposed to have. Comes loaded with one (1) genuine investigation in progress. No refunds."</em></p></div><div class="listing" style="max-width:620px;margin:8px auto;border:1px dashed #39707a;padding:10px;text-align:left"><strong>OBSCURA GATEWAY KEY [ACTIVE]</strong><p>Price: 1,200 GMA :: Seller: ANON-3335 :: Status: ESCROW</p><p style="font-size:0.85em;color:#666"><em>"Tier-7 routing. Avoids cult webcrawlers AND Foundation honeypots. Pairs well with any unmarked terminal. (This seller has been silent for eleven days)"</em></p></div><div class="listing" style="max-width:620px;margin:8px auto;border:1px dashed #39707a;padding:10px;text-align:left"><strong>DARK THRONE ENTRY TOKEN</strong><p>Price: ??? GMA :: Seller: <del>methymike23</del> :: Status: <em style="color:#9c173b">"taken"</em></p><p style="font-size:0.85em;color:#666"><em>listing removed by moderator.</em></p></div><p style="text-align:center;max-width:620px;margin:14px auto"><em>"This is not the deepest market on the Obscura. One exists, further down."</em></p>
