**Crimson Skies: The Smell of Blood**



How much of yourself are you willing to lose in order to save the ones you love? By the time it's all over, will you recognize yourself in the mirror?



**Content Warnings:** blood, gore, death, self harm; intrusive thoughts/compulsions; references to human trafficking



[[[badooga-author-page|More By Badooga]]]



